    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Licensing of trustees and groups of individual trustees Part 2A Approval to hold a controlling stake in an RSE licensee Division 8",
            "block_bbox": [
                369,
                13,
                1000,
                69
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Section 29HD ",
            "block_bbox": [
                836,
                97,
                1000,
                119
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Subdivision C-Approval ",
            "block_bbox": [
                161,
                169,
                504,
                197
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "29HD Approval to hold a controlling stake in an RSE licensee ",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                229,
                920,
                258
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "APRA must give approval for a person to hold a controlling stake in an RSE licensee if, and only if:.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                297,
                279,
                989,
                331
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) the application for approval complies with section 29HA; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                313,
                336,
                1011,
                365
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) the applicant has provided to APRA all information that the.applicant was requested under section 29HB to provide, or the request has been disposed of; and.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                312,
                371,
                1003,
                450
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) APRA has no reason to believe that, because of the person's controlling stake in the RSE licensee, or the way in which that controlling stake is likely to be used, the RSE licensee.may be unable to satisfy one or more of the trustee's obligations contained in a covenant set out in sections 52 to.53, or prescribed under section 54A.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                312,
                459,
                1003,
                625
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "29HE Notice of approval ",
            "block_bbox": [
                156,
                663,
                476,
                690
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If APRA gives a person approval to hold a controlling stake in an.RSE licensee, APRA must notify the RSE licensee in writing of the.approval.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                292,
                711,
                1027,
                803
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "29HF APRA to give notice of refusal of approval ",
            "block_bbox": [
                158,
                836,
                776,
                864
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If APRA refuses an application by a person for approval to hold a controlling stake in an RSE licensee, APRA must take all reasonable steps to ensure that the person is given a notice:",
            "block_bbox": [
                295,
                882,
                1015,
                971
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) informing it of APRA's refusal of the application; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                317,
                976,
                958,
                1005
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) setting out the reasons for the refusal;",
            "block_bbox": [
                318,
                1011,
                774,
                1036
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "as soon as practicable after refusing the application.",
            "block_bbox": [
                301,
                1042,
                864,
                1072
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superanmuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
            "block_bbox": [
                452,
                1307,
                832,
                1333
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
